{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents may include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667390/extras/TopDescription.gif?t=1747301883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pond full of fish,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667390/extras/MiddleDescription.gif?t=1747301883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hungry, hungry black hole,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667390/extras/ThirdDescription.gif?t=1747301883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgradeable spawners to keep the pond topped up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667390/extras/FinalDescription.gif?t=1747301883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And an infinite supply of fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to catch fish the old fashioned way. That doesn't work, so use a black-hole fueled whirlpool instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your fish to make a bigger and bigger whirlpool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drain the pond - only to discover another pond below the pond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross-breed fish to create the ultimate scoring machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the center of the Earth - and destroy all life in a very fishy way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I apologize for the fish pun earlier in the description. This is the only one, I promise \ud83e\udd1e</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667390?t=1747301883","background_raw":"https://shared.aka